<body>
    <h1>Cardiff AI+ Installer Setup &amp; Configuration Guide</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step1:Log=
intoAI+ConfigurationPanel">Step 1: Login to AI+ Configuration Panel</h2>
<p>Access the configuration panel for AI+ services via:</p>
<p><strong>URL: </strong><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://10.20.1.=
73:8080/servers" rel=3D"nofollow">http://10.20.1.73:8080/servers</a></p>
<p>Ensure that the installer is completed and the server is active.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step2:CopyTLSCert=
ificatesfromPixstoreServer">Step 2: Copy TLS Certificates from Pixstore Ser=
ver</h2>
<p>To configure RabbitMQ with TLS, you need to securely transfer the requir=
ed certificates from the Pixstore server to the AI+ Server.</p>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Source(Pixstore)P=
ath">Source (Pixstore) Path</h3>
<p>The certificates are located at:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">/var/li=
b/pixstor/iris/mcs-runtime/mcs-core/rabbitmq/tls</pre>
</div>
</div>
<blockquote>
<p>SSH into the Pixstore server at <code>10.20.0.160</code> using the provi=
ded credentials.</p>
<p><strong>IP</strong>: 10.20.0.160</p>
<p><strong>Username</strong>: root</p>
<p><strong>Password</strong>: edison2</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Example:">Example=
:</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">ssh roo=
t@10.20.0.160
cd /var/lib/pixstor/iris/mcs-runtime/mcs-core/rabbitmq/tls
ls</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Expected files:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">ca.crt =
 tls.crt  tls.key</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Copycertificatest=
oAI+Server">Copy certificates to AI+ Server</h3>
<p>Run the following <code>scp</code> command <strong>from the Pixstore ser=
ver</strong> to securely copy the files:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">scp ca.=
crt tls.crt tls.key aiuser@10.20.1.73:/opt/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq</pre>
</div>
</div>
<blockquote>
<p>Ensure that the <code>/opt/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq</code> directory alread=
y exists on the AI+ Server. If not, create it:</p>
</blockquote>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">mkdir -=
p /opt/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-VerifyfilesontheA=
I+Server">Verify files on the AI+ Server</h3>
<p>Log in to the AI+ Server and confirm the certificates are copied correct=
ly:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">ls /opt=
/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Expected output:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">ca.crt =
 tls.crt  tls.key</pre>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step3:UpdateConfi=
gurationGUI">Step 3: Update Configuration GUI</h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Open <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://10.20.1.73:8080/configura=
tion" rel=3D"nofollow">http://10.20.1.73:8080/configuration</a> in your bro=
wser.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Go to <strong>Transcribe Summarize =E2=86=92 RabbitMQ =E2=86=92 Connecti=
on</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enable the <strong>TLS</strong> checkbox.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Set the certificate paths to the following:</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">CA File=
   : /etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/ca.crt
Cert File : /etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/tls.crt
Key File  : /etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/tls.key</pre>
</div>
</div>
<blockquote>
<p>These should point to the mounted path as configured within the containe=
r, not necessarily the same as <code>/opt/</code> from the host machine.</p=
>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-RabbitMQConfigura=
tion">RabbitMQ Configuration</h3>
<p>Fill in the following RabbitMQ details:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Host:</strong> <code>10.20.0.160</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Port:</strong> <code>5671</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Username</strong>: jdZRJ0fnfeSd</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Password</strong>: J00kK9dxJ5VTUxrSgIFl79M1</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step4:ConfigureTN=
S(TranscribeSummarize)viaServerManagement">Step 4: Configure TNS (Transcrib=
e Summarize) via Server Management</h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Navigate to <strong>Servers =E2=86=92 Manage =E2=86=92 TNS Config</stron=
g></p></li>
</ol>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p>Ensure your <code>docker-compose.yml</code> file for the <strong>Transcr=
ibe Summarize</strong> service contains the correct volume mappings and env=
ironment variables.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Requiredvolumes:S=
ection">Required <code>volumes:</code> Section</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">volumes=
:
  - ${IRIS_MOUNT_POINT:-/mmfs1/data}:/app/media
  - ${RABBITMQ_CERTS:-/opt/aiplus/certs}:/etc/aiplus/certs</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Requiredenvironme=
nt:Variables">Required <code>environment:</code> Variables</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">PORT=3D=
9003
MEDIA_DIR=3D/opt/aiplus/media
OUTPUT_DIR=3D/opt/aiplus/outputs
IRIS_MOUNT_POINT=3D/mmfs1/data
RABBITMQ_CERTS=3D/opt/aiplus/certs
IMAGE=3D832471001844.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/aiplus/transcribe-summ=
arize:1.1.0-rc5</pre>
</div>
</div>
<blockquote>
<p>Confirm that all directories are correctly mounted and the environment v=
ariables are accurately reflected in the compose file.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step5:UpdateRabbi=
tMQExchangeStatusinConsul">Step 5: Update RabbitMQ Exchange Status in Consu=
l</h2>
<p>After the Transcribe Summarize container is configured and RabbitMQ cert=
s are in place, update the exchange status in <strong>Consul</strong> to en=
sure proper routing and connection status.</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Open the Consul UI:<br><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://10.20.1=
.73:8500/ui/dc1/kv/services/transcribe-summarize/rabbitmq/exchanges/status/=
" rel=3D"nofollow">http://10.20.1.73:8500/ui/dc1/kv/services/transcribe-sum=
marize/rabbitmq/exchanges/status/</a></p></li>
<li>
<p>Click <strong>Create</strong> to add a new key-value pair.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Set the following:</p></li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Key</strong> =3D <code>enabled</code></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Value</strong> =3D <code>false</code></p></li>
</ul>
<ol start=3D"4">
<li>
<p>Click <strong>Save</strong> to confirm.</p></li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p>This disables the exchange by default; it can be toggled to <code>true</=
code> after validation steps or service readiness checks.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step6:ConfigureNo=
tificationAPISettings">Step 6: Configure Notification API Settings</h2>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-1.AccessNotificat=
ionAPIConfiguration">1. Access Notification API Configuration</h3>
<p>Navigate to <strong>configuration =E2=86=92 notification-api.</strong></=
p>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-2.TLSSection">2. =
TLS Section</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Go to the <strong>TLS</strong> section.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirm that <strong>Enabled</strong> is set to <strong>false</strong>.<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-3.VerifySystems">=
3. Verify Systems</h3>
<p>Ensure that the <strong>Systems</strong> field is set to:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">iris</p=
re>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step7:ConfigureRa=
bbitMQforNotificationAPI">Step 7: Configure RabbitMQ for Notification API</=
h2>
<p>Update the RabbitMQ settings <strong>manually</strong>, just like in the=
 Transcribe Summarize setup.</p>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-RabbitMQ=E2=86=92=
Connection">RabbitMQ =E2=86=92 Connection</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"dc=
fe7fba-4c81-473e-aadf-94c20ff9f13a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Value</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enabled</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>true</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Host</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>10.20.0.160</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Port</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>5671</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Username</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>jdZRJ0fnfeSd</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Password</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>J00kK9dxJ5VTUxrSgIFl79M1</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-RabbitMQ=E2=86=92=
TLS">RabbitMQ =E2=86=92 TLS</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"ac=
b5b4ac-3ee8-4024-b6aa-2e13436c399d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Path</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enabled</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>true</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>CA File</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>/etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/ca.crt</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Cert File</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>/etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/tls.crt</code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Key File</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><code>/etc/aiplus/certs/rabbitmq/tls.key</code></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-RabbitMQ=E2=86=92=
Exchanges=E2=86=92QueueNameTemplate">RabbitMQ =E2=86=92 Exchanges =E2=86=92=
 Queue Name Template</h3>
<p>Update the <strong>Processing Queue Name Template</strong> field with:</=
p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">pixstor=
-fs-events-xchg_{service.component_name}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Then save the configuration.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step9:VerifyQueue=
NameTemplateinConsul">Step 9: Verify Queue Name Template in Consul</h2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Open Consul at: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://10.20.1.73:850=
0/ui/dc1/kv/services/notification-api/rabbitmq/queues/processing/name_templ=
ate/edit" rel=3D"nofollow">http://10.20.1.73:8500/ui/dc1/kv/services/notifi=
cation-api/rabbitmq/queues/processing/name_template/edit</a></p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirm that the value is set to:</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">"pixsto=
r-fs-events-xchg_{service.component_name}"</pre>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step10:RestartNot=
ificationAPIService">Step 10: Restart Notification API Service</h2>
<p>After all configurations are saved and verified:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Go to the server where the notification-api service is running.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Restart the service.</p></li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p>Make sure the new settings (certs, queue name templates, etc.) are picke=
d up properly after the restart.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"CardiffAI+InstallerSetup&amp;ConfigurationGuide-Step11:ConfigureT=
ranscribeSummarizeFoldertobeProcessed"><strong>Step 11: Configure </strong>=
<code>TranscribeSummarize</code><strong> Folder to be Processed</strong></h=
2>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Access Vision UI:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Open the Vision interface:<br>
=F0=9F=94=97 <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://ca-sn-dev-01.om.car=
